aven:3.9.0-eclipse-temurin-11 mvn test -pl hugegraph-server/hugegraph-test -am -P api-test,memory -Drat.skip=true -DskipITs -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dtest=VertexApiTest` | `working-tree` | FAIL (API server unavailable; connection refused) | `api-rest-001-vertex-java11-20260913.log` |\\n| `timeout 180s bash tools/rust-rewrite-cluster/smoke.sh` | `working-tree` | FAIL (startup and initial REST writes passed, recovery phase timed out/connection reset; exit 124) | `api-rest-001-server-start-20260913.log` |\\n| `docker run --rm --network host -v /home/zy/code/hugegraph:/workspace -v /home/zy/.m2:/root/.m2 -w /workspace maven:3.9.0-eclipse-temurin-11 mvn test -pl hugegraph-server/hugegraph-test -am -P api-test,memory -Drat.skip=true -DskipITs -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dtest=VertexApiTest` | `working-tree` | PASS (4 tests, 0 failures, BUILD SUCCESS, exit 0) | `api-rest-001-vertex-java11-hostnet-20260913.log` |\\n| `docker run --rm -v /home/zy/code/hugegraph:/workspace -v /home/zy/.m2:/root/.m2 -w /workspace maven:3.9.0-eclipse-temurin-11 mvn test -pl hugegraph-server/hugegraph-test -am -P core-test,memory -Drat.skip=true -DskipITs -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dtest=VertexCoreTest#testAddVertexWithUniqueIndex` | `working-tree` | PASS (1 test, 0 failures, BUILD SUCCESS, exit 0) | `schema-001-unique-index-java11-20260913.log` |\\n| `docker run --rm -v /home/zy/code/hugegraph:/workspace -v /home/zy/.m2:/root/.m2 -w /workspace maven:3.9.0-eclipse-temurin-11 mvn test -pl hugegraph-server/hugegraph-test -am -P core-test,memory -Drat.skip=true -DskipITs -DfailIfNoTests=false -Dtest=PrimaryKeyStrategyCoreTest#testFoldsSingleCardinalityProperties` | `working-tree` | PASS (BUILD SUCCESS, exit 0) | `txn-001-primarykey-java11-20260913.log` |\\n| `timeout 240s bash tools/rust-rewrite-cluster/smoke.sh` | `working-tree` | FAIL (RAFT recovery: connection reset after store0 restart) | `raft-001-three-node-smoke-20260913.log` |\\n| `bash -n tools/rust-rewrite-cluster/smoke.sh; timeout 360s bash tools/r